# Paths or filenames to never clean (one per line).
# Copy to ~/Data/clean_dropbox_exclude.txt and edit.
#
# Basename only (matches anywhere): e.g. keep one specific .dmg
# Perry-HR-2022.dmg
#
# Full path relative to Dropbox (exact match): e.g. keep one file in a folder
# HR/Perry-HR-2022.dmg
#
# Lines with # are comments; blank lines are ignored.

